Tab5 native Bluetooth Classic / A2DP demo
Put headphones in pairing mode, then: a2dp find, a2dp list, a2dp pair <n | address>
(or a2dp pair: pair the first audio device found)
After streaming starts: a2dp tone 440 | a2dp tone off | a2dp status | a2dp stop
Saved headphones: a2dp list | a2dp connect [n] | a2dp forget <n> | Boot reconnect: a2dp auto 1
Diagnostics: a2dp diag | a2dp chans | a2dp sbc | BR modulation: a2dp brmod <hex|0>
Pause/resume: headphone keys | a2dp suspend | a2dp resume
Sample rate: a2dp rates [clear] (learned per device) | a2dp rate48 <0|1|auto>
Quality reconnect: a2dp qmax <pct> (100/default disables)
Stop the link before resetting or flashing. Type help to repeat.␀␀␀Command too long; discarded.␀␀␀␀a2dp␀␀␀␀demo_ui␀W (%lu) %s: Command queue full
